Origin:
  The 3D HomeView pet, the loopback receiver, the H.264 data plane and the iAP2/MFi
  probe were written in the WindowShade repository (tools/homeview-pet, tools/carplay)
  and moved here at WindowShade commit b60b402.

Protocol references:
  The CarPlay session control plane in this project (Sources/Session) is a Swift
  re-implementation that follows the behaviour of MacPlay and LIVI:
    MacPlay: https://github.com/Roylyl/MacPlay (GPL-3.0-or-later)
    LIVI: https://github.com/f-io/LIVI — original author Lasse Heitgres and LIVI contributors
      (GPL-3.0-or-later)
    DiPlay: https://github.com/shihabal3amri/DiPlay (referenced by MacPlay)
  Their copyrights are retained; HomePlay is distributed under the same licence family.

Authentication material:
  The public source snapshot contains no accessory identity. The signed binary may
  bundle a public experimental identity. If you build from source and want CarPlay,
  supply your own identity.pk8 + certificate.p7b; its origin and legality are the
  user's responsibility. Tools never print identity contents.

